			icon: "ae2:sky_stone_block"
			title: "Find the Meteorite"
			subtitle: "Sky stone, and four presses"
			description: [
				"AE2 buries &6meteorites&r across the world, each with a chest holding &6Inscriber"
				"Presses&r. Without all four presses the mod stops dead at the inscriber, so keep"
				"looking until you have them."
				""
				"A &6Meteorite Compass&r, charged in a Charger, points at the nearest one."
				""
				"&7The network itself runs along the top of this page and hooks back to the"
				"capstone. Cables and power drop away to the left; autocrafting to the right.&r"
			]
